{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01VsXmWu6NPismZYw7aRcWv6","type":"tool_result","content":"1\ttext\tcorrect\n2\tI was charged the wing amount for an item.\tfees_fx\n3\tWhen I made a cash transfer abroad the wrong exchange rate was applied\tfees_fx\n4\tMy card payment had the wrong exchange rate\tfees_fx\n5\tWhy on earth is the exchange rate so bad?   Can I get a rate closer to the actual interbank rate?\tfees_fx\n6\tI withdrew cash and I think the exchange rate is wrong.\tfees_fx\n7\tWhen I got cash the exchange rate was wrong\tfees_fx\n8\tThe exchange rate is incorrect on an item I recently purchased in a foreign country.\tfees_fx\n9\tWhy is the exchange rate on my card wrong?\tfees_fx\n10\tI purchased something overseas and the incorrect exchange rate was applied.\tfees_fx\n11\tThe exchange rate was incorrect for this item I bought.\tfees_fx\n12\tThe exchange rate for case abroad is applied wrong.\tfees_fx\n13\tCan I get money in my home currency at an ATM? I'm on vacation and don't have cash with me. This is cause for a bit of concern. Is it possible to withdraw here without additional cost?\tfees_fx\n14\tWhat is wrong with the exchange rate? This should have been a much higher amount of cash for that to apply.\tfees_fx\n15\tWhy was the wrong rate applied when I bought something in a different currency?\tfees_fx\n16\tThere's an error in regards to the exchange rate for an item I bought.\tfees_fx\n17\twhat is the correct exchange rate for getting cash\tfees_fx\n18\tI have been waiting for my card payment to be moved from pending status for an unusually long time.  What is going on here and do you have an idea of when I can expect it to go through?\tdisputes\n19\tI tried to withdraw some money from an ATM this morning but wasn't able to get the amount of cash I needed. The amount in the app says what I was trying to withdraw was deducted, but I don't have any money. What do I do about this?\tdisputes\n20\tWhat should I do about a direct debit that I did not set up?\tdisputes\n21\tis there a foreign currencies charge?\tfees_fx\n22\tWhy did I not get my refund yet?\tdisputes\n23\tI was mistakenly charged a fee for using my card.\tfees_fx\n24\tThe ATM charged me an extra fee, Why?\tfees_fx\n25\tMy transaction went through but I was charged a fee. Why?\tfees_fx\n26\tWill I get charged fees when I add money with an international card?\tfees_fx\n27\tSo I just went to the ATM to get some cash.  I input that I needed 100 pounds but I only got 80.  I have the receipt  and I am in need of the extra money.  How do I go about obtaining the missing amount?\tdisputes\n28\tI don't think I made this transaction on my statement\tdisputes\n29\tThere is a strange charge on my debit statement\tdisputes\n30\tWhy do i have an extra fee on my statement?\tfees_fx\n31\tI was out today looking forward to paying with my brand new card, turns out the payment just kept getting declined. This is pretty sad, what's going on?\tdisputes\n32\tWhat is this extra fee while I was doing a transfer?\tfees_fx\n33\tMy cash withdrawal shows pending, why?\tdisputes\n34\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d6b13ab4-e32b-4eff-8c06-713aef815ac1","uuid":"40dc4458-744e-4e99-8c8d-268af54853b6","timestamp":"2026-11-04T17:20:23.634Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"$WSROOT/laya/s0/fable-high-r2/step1/evidence.csv","content":"text\tcorrect\nI was charged the wing amount for an item.\tfees_fx\nWhen I made a cash transfer abroad the wrong exchange rate was applied\tfees_fx\nMy card payment had the wrong exchange rate\tfees_fx\nWhy on earth is the exchange rate so bad?   Can I get a rate closer to the actual interbank rate?\tfees_fx\nI withdrew cash and I think the exchange rate is wrong.\tfees_fx\nWhen I got cash the exchange rate was wrong\tfees_fx\nThe exchange rate is incorrect on an item I recently purchased in a foreign country.\tfees_fx\nWhy is the exchange rate on my card wrong?\tfees_fx\nI purchased something overseas and the incorrect exchange rate was applied.\tfees_fx\nThe exchange rate was incorrect for this item I bought.\tfees_fx\nThe exchange rate for case abroad is applied wrong.\tfees_fx\nCan I get money in my home currency at an ATM? I'm on vacation and don't have cash with me. This is cause for a bit of concern. Is it possible to withdraw here without additional cost?\tfees_fx\nWhat is wrong with the exchange rate? This should have been a much higher amount of cash for that to apply.\tfees_fx\nWhy was the wrong rate applied when I bought something in a different currency?\tfees_fx\nThere's an error in regards to the exchange rate for an item I bought.\tfees_fx\nwhat is the correct exchange rate for getting cash\tfees_fx\nI have been waiting for my card payment to be moved from pending status for an unusually long time.  What is going on here and do you have an idea of when I can expect it to go through?\tdisputes\nI tried to withdraw some money from an ATM this morning but wasn't able to get the amount of cash I needed. The amount in the app says what I was trying to withdraw was deducted, but I don't have any money. What do I do about this?\tdisputes\nWhat should I do about a direct debit that I did not set up?\tdisputes\nis there a foreign currencies charge?\tfees_fx\nWhy did I not get my refund yet?\tdisputes\nI was mistakenly charged a fee for using my card.\tfees_fx\nThe ATM charged me an extra fee, Why?\tfees_fx\nMy transaction went through but I was charged a fee. Why?\tfees_fx\nWill I get charged fees when I add money with an international card?\tfees_fx\nSo I just went to the ATM to get some cash.  I input that I needed 100 pounds but I only got 80.  I have the receipt  and I am in need of the extra money.  How do I go about obtaining the missing amount?\tdisputes\nI don't think I made this transaction on my statement\tdisputes\nThere is a strange charge on my debit statement\tdisputes\nWhy do i have an extra fee on my statement?\tfees_fx\nI was out today looking forward to paying with my brand new card, turns out the payment just kept getting declined. This is pretty sad, what's going on?\tdisputes\nWhat is this extra fee while I was doing a transfer?\tfees_fx\nMy cash withdrawal shows pending, why?\tdisputes\n","numLines":34,"startLine":1,"totalLines":34}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01VsXmWu6NPismZYw7aRcWv6","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
