ught abroad because of the rate.\",\n    \"The exchange rate for my card payment does not match the official rate.\",\n    \"I withdrew money overseas and I was given a really bad exchange rate.\",\n    \"Incorrect exchange rate on a payment I made with my card in Japan.\",\n    \"You applied the wrong exchange rate to my cash withdrawal.\",\n    \"The amount deducted for my foreign purchase is wrong, the exchange rate is off.\",\n    \"I don't agree with the exchange rate used on my transaction abroad.\",\n    \"The currency rate on my ATM withdrawal was unfair.\",\n    \"My card payment was converted at a bad exchange rate.\",\n    \"I noticed the exchange rate on my recent purchase was incorrect.\",\n]\nNEG_DISP = [  # genuine disputes -> disputes\n    \"There is a card payment on my statement that I did not make.\",\n    \"I do not recognise this transaction on my account.\",\n    \"I was charged twice for the same purchase.\",\n    \"My card payment is still pending after three days.\",\n    \"My cash withdrawal is showing as pending, why?\",\n    \"The ATM did not give me any cash but my account was debited.\",\n    \"I asked for 200 at the ATM and only got 100.\",\n    \"A direct debit was taken that I never set up.\",\n    \"My card payment was declined at the shop today.\",\n    \"The cash machine declined my withdrawal.\",\n    \"I still have not received my refund for a returned item.\",\n    \"A payment I made was reverted, what happened?\",\n    \"Someone used my card for a payment I did not authorise.\",\n    \"There is a strange charge on my statement I do not know.\",\n    \"How do I get a refund for a payment that went wrong?\",\n    \"The merchant charged me but I never got the goods, can I dispute it?\",\n    \"My transaction shows twice in the app.\",\n    \"I made a withdrawal that is not on my statement yet.\",\n    \"Why was my payment declined when I have enough money?\",\n    \"My cash withdrawal was not recognised by me, I did not do it.\",\n    \"The seller said they refunded me but I see nothing.\",\n    \"I was charged the wrong amount by a shop, they overcharged me.\",\n    \"A payment I did not make appeared on my card.\",\n    \"My top up card payment was declined.\",\n    \"The ATM took my money but no cash came out.\",\n]\nNEG_FEE = [  # fee / fx questions already in fees_fx (false positives here are harmless)\n    \"What is the fee for withdrawing cash abroad?\",\n    \"Why was I charged a fee on my card payment?\",\n    \"Do you charge for currency exchange?\",\n    \"What exchange rate do you use?\",\n    \"Which currencies can I hold in my account?\",\n    \"There is an extra charge on my statement, why?\",\n    \"Is there a fee for topping up by card?\",\n    \"How is the exchange rate calculated?\",\n]\nNEG_OTHER = [  # other departments\n    \"I lost my card, please block it.\",\n    \"How do I activate my new card?\",\n    \"Can I use Apple Pay with my card?\",\n    \"My card has not arrived yet.\",\n    \"I forgot my PIN.\",\n    \"How do I top up my account by bank transfer?\",\n    \"I sent a transfer yesterday and it has not arrived.\",\n    \"My balance has not updated after my deposit.\",\n    \"How long does a bank transfer take?\",\n    \"I need to verify my identity.\",\n    \"How do I change my passcode?\",\n    \"I want to close my account.\",\n    \"I lost my phone, what should I do?\",\n    \"What is the minimum age to open an account?\",\n    \"Can I open an account from Canada?\",\n    \"How do I get a virtual card?\",\n    \"Why is my contactless not working?\",\n    \"Can I transfer money to a friend in another country?\",\n    \"How do I change my address?\",\n    \"Is my money safe with you?\",\n]\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2582,"cache_read_input_tokens":86955,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_to