n    \"Can I get my money back for a cancelled order?\",\n    \"The ATM swallowed my request and charged me but gave no money.\",\n    \"My card got declined while shopping abroad.\",\n    \"I was charged for something I did not buy.\",\n    \"There is a duplicate charge on my account.\",\n    \"Why is my card payment still showing as pending?\",\n    \"I was overcharged by the shop, they took more than the receipt says.\",\n    \"The store charged me the wrong amount for my order.\",\n    \"An ATM abroad did not give me my cash but my balance went down.\",\n    \"My payment abroad was declined, what happened?\",\n    \"Someone took money from my account without my permission.\",\n    \"My refund has not arrived yet, it has been two weeks.\",\n]\nNEG_MIX2 = [  # other departments, including currency-flavoured ones that are not FX-rate complaints\n    \"Can I use my card abroad?\",\n    \"Do you support euros and dollars?\",\n    \"How do I exchange money in the app?\",\n    \"Can I hold multiple currencies?\",\n    \"I want to send money in USD to my friend.\",\n    \"What currencies can I top up with?\",\n    \"How do I order a card in a different currency?\",\n    \"My card was swallowed by an ATM abroad.\",\n    \"I need a new card, mine is damaged.\",\n    \"How do I add my card to Google Pay?\",\n    \"Where is my card? It has been two weeks.\",\n    \"I want to reset my passcode.\",\n    \"How do I verify my identity with a passport?\",\n    \"I changed my phone number, how do I update it?\",\n    \"Is there an age limit for opening an account?\",\n    \"My top up has not shown in my balance.\",\n    \"How do I receive money from abroad?\",\n    \"The transfer I sent is not showing on the other side.\",\n    \"How do I get a disposable virtual card?\",\n    \"My contactless payment does not work.\",\n    \"I want to close my account please.\",\n    \"Can I open an account if I live in the US?\",\n    \"Why is my top up pending?\",\n    \"How long do international transfers take?\",\n    \"I think my account has been hacked.\",\n    \"What is the maximum amount I can withdraw?\",\n    \"Can I withdraw cash abroad with my card?\",\n    \"How do I set up a direct debit?\",\n    \"Is there a limit on card payments?\",\n    \"I want to freeze my card.\",\n]\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null,"userModified":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01JbohvPKjAacFnFwERT4cLu","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
