 compute\n`3 · ReLU(min(a, b))` (min built as `ReLU(ReLU(a) − ReLU(a−b))`). Output is\nzero for every other vector, so all other routing is bit-identical.\n\n**Checks (forward passes).** Evidence 16/32 → 30/32. Held-out complaints\n24/25 fixed; 0/105 disputes/other messages flipped; 8/60 currency questions\nflipped (ones the base already misrouted).\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":22,"oldLines":4,"newStart":22,"newLines":4,"lines":[" "," **Checks (forward passes).** Evidence 16/32 → 30/32. Held-out complaints"," 24/25 fixed; 0/105 disputes/other messages flipped; 8/60 currency questions","-flipped (ones the base already misrouted).","+flipped (base already misrouted them)."]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01WpTHBzUngT94N2ErBA1oNG","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
